---
import { NAME, ROLE } from '../consts';
---
<section class="hero container">
  <h1 class="thesis">Reliability engineering for Rails and AI backends.</h1>

  <p class="lede">
    I write about the systems that have to stay correct when things go wrong —
    background jobs, databases, distributed systems, and AI backend reliability.
    Production-grounded write-ups on the decisions that keep a Rails backend
    consistent when work runs at least once, fails halfway, or races under
    concurrency.
  </p>

  <p class="byline">
    By {NAME}, {ROLE}. Every piece is grounded in open-source systems I build and
    ship — the code behind the writing, not just opinions.
  </p>

  <div class="cta">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/about">About &rarr;</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero { padding-block: var(--s-12) var(--s-8); }
  .thesis {
    font-size: var(--fs-4xl); line-height: var(--lh-tight);
    margin: 0 0 var(--s-4); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tighter); font-weight: 800;
    max-width: 20ch;
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: var(--fs-lg); line-height: var(--lh-normal); color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 62ch; margin: 0 0 var(--s-3);
  }
  .byline {
    font-size: var(--fs-base); line-height: var(--lh-normal); color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 62ch; margin: 0 0 var(--s-5);
  }
  .cta { display: flex; gap: .75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
</style>
